!deploy/**

# Do not send local dependencies, generated output or credentials to the builder.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*service-account*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
